      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romeo%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dozens of stately Victorian mansions still line Romeo’s streets, a testament to its prosperous past.",
