      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romeo%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Romeo’s downtown has never suffered a major fire, preserving its historic streetscape for generations.",
